, "end": 67900, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 64460, "text": "You don't know how many inputs they'll give before typing quit."}, {"confidence": 0.87948793, "end": 69460, "sentiment": "POSITIVE", "start": 67980, "text": "So a while loop is perfect."}, {"confidence": 0.55097127, "end": 69820, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 69460, "text": "There."}, {"confidence": 0.65688586, "end": 72780, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 69980, "text": "The loop continues while the input is not quit."}, {"confidence": 0.60899544, "end": 75820, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 74940, "text": "Oh, I see."}, {"confidence": 0.9113667, "end": 85930, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 76300, "text": "So for is for a definition number of iteration and while is for an identified number based on condition."}, {"confidence": 0.6728841, "end": 88330, "sentiment": "POSITIVE", "start": 86250, "text": "That cleans it a lot."}, {"confidence": 0.6082007, "end": 88890, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 88410, "text": "Loud."}, {"confidence": 0.8917238, "end": 93450, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 89770, "text": "Maybe try a quick sample of a for loop?"}, {"confidence": 0.52642864, "end": 94890, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 94090, "text": "Certainly."}, {"confidence": 0.7002215, "end": 100090, "sentiment": "NEUTRAL", "start": 94890, "text": "Let's open up the editor and code a small guessing game that's a classic while rope scenario."}]	9b9a2a9a-fa2e-442d-bdee-c2b61a07e088	f
